rrently have no therapy-session note (or an explicit facility per-diem level statement for those dates). Citations used: Physical Therapy note (Physical Therapy, p. 18-19); SECTION O (SECTION O, p. 15); Physician Progress Notes (PHYSICIAN PROGRESS NOTES - SNF STAY, p. 222); PT daily note (Physical Therapy, 02/10/2026, p. 33); OT treatment note (Occupational Therapy, 02/17/2026, p. 73).",
